// 7. residuals r = φ_DR − Σ w·base_oof; MAD-clip at ±4 MAD; fit refinement models on r
// 8. λ ← clip(Σ refine_oof·r / Σ refine_oof², [0,1])
// 9. predict: $\hat\tau(x) = (\sum_j w_j g_j(x) + \lambda\,\bar h(x))\,\sigma_Y$
